  "system": {
    "description": "<p>You compel your enemy's body to turn against itself, causing muscles to cramp, blood to still, and organs to malfunction.</p><p>Choose a creature within <strong>10 spaces</strong>. At the start of its turn, it takes <strong>1 Damage</strong> that ignores <strong>Armor</strong>.</p><p>Additionally, the target must make an opposed <strong>Resilience</strong> check or be <strong>Stunned</strong> until the end of its next turn.</p><p>Each extra success extends the duration by <strong>+1 rounds</strong>.</p><p>Alternatively, you may increase the <strong>Damage</strong> by <strong>+1</strong> per extra success.</p><p>If you have some piece of the target's body (blood, hair, etc.), then the <strong>Range</strong> of this spell increases to <strong>50 spaces</strong>, and the target has <strong>Disadvantage</strong> on its <strong>Resilience</strong> check.</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.TaY4bE9vPRnoCYFC]{Anatomical Anarchy}</p>",
